            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`. As in `read()` is now re-detects sessions not only before, but also after reading a session. This should keep `MiniSessions.detected` up to date after its own functions.\n\nIt still can become outdated after manual change of working directory though, but it will become irrelevant during execution of any function from 'mini.sessions' (as they all re-detect prior to taking action).",
